# State System

The animation changes based on the assistant state.

## Idle

Minimal movement.

```
small pulse
slow breathing
soft glow
```

## Listening

Assistant is waiting for input.

```
slightly larger
faster pulse
more glow
```

## Thinking

Assistant is processing.

```
subtle rotation
fluid motion
increased deformation
```

## Speaking

Assistant is responding.

```
shape reacts to audio amplitude
strong glow
dynamic deformation
```

